7. ENGINEERING THE HARNESS
Recurring failure → Encode the fix in the harness → Evaluate on real tasks → Keep it if outcomes improve

Encode the fix can mean:
• add or revise AGENTS.md guidance
• add a test, linter, or schema check
• improve tool definition or permissions
• expose missing state or richer observability
• add checkpoints, summaries, or reusable artifacts

A well-engineered harness turns raw model capability into reliable, inspectable, and repeatable behavior.
